Source: nvidia-graphics-drivers-legacy-71xx
Section: non-free/x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Debian NVIDIA Maintainers <pkg-nvidia-devel@lists.alioth.debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>> 5.0.0), sed (>> 3.0)
Standards-Version: 3.7.2


Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx-ia32
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nvidia-kernel-legacy-71xx-#VERSION#, ia32-libs, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-settings, nvidia-kernel-legacy-71xx-source (>= #VERSION#)
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-ia32
Replaces: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-legacy-ia32, nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx-ia32
Description: NVIDIA binary Xorg driver (71xx legacy version)
 These Xorg binary drivers provide optimized hardware acceleration of
 OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server. AGP, TV-out and
 flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 Please see the nvidia-kernel-legacy-71xx-source package for building the kernel 
 module required by this package.

Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: nvidia-kernel-legacy-71xx-#VERSION#, x11-common, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-settings, nvidia-kernel-legacy-71xx-source (>= #VERSION#)
Provides: xserver-xorg-video-1.0
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx, nvidia-glx-legacy, nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx
Replaces: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-legacy
Description: NVIDIA binary Xorg driver (71xx legacy version)
 These Xorg  binary drivers provide optimized hardware 
 acceleration of  OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server. 
 AGP, PCIe, SLI, TV-out and flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 This legacy version supports:
 RIVA TNT, RIVA TNT2/TNT2 Pro, RIVA TNT2 Ultra, Vanta/Vanta LT
 RIVA TNT2 Model 64/Model 64 Pro, Aladdin TNT2,  GeForce 256
 GeForce DDR, Quadro,  GeForce2 GTS/GeForce2 Pro, GeForce2 Ti
 GeForce2 Ultra, Quadro2 Pro
 .
 Please see the nvidia-kernel-legacy-source package for building the kernel 
 module required by this package.
 
Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx-dev
Architecture: i386 amd64
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-dev, nvidia-glx-legacy, nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx, libgl-dev, mesa-common-dev, x11proto-gl-dev
Replaces: libgl-dev, nvidia-glx-legacy
Provides: libgl-dev
Depends: nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx (>= #VERSION#)
Description: NVIDIA binary Xorg driver development files
 This package contains the NVIDIA binary Xorg driver
 development files.
 .
 For more information on this source package visit NVIDIA's homepage
 at http://www.nvidia.com/ .

Package: nvidia-kernel-legacy-71xx-source
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: debhelper (>> 4.0.0), make, sed (>> 3.0), dpatch (>= 2.0.0)
Recommends: nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx (>= #VERSION#), kernel-package (>= 8.082), devscripts
Conflicts: nvidia-kernel-src, nvidia-kernel-legacy-source
Replaces: nvidia-kernel-src, nvidia-kernel-legacy-source
Description: NVIDIA binary kernel module source (71xx legacy version)
 This package builds the NVIDIA Xorg  binary kernel module 
 needed  by nvidia-glx-legacy. The drivers provide optimized hardware acceleration 
 of OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server AGP,
 PCIe, SLI, TV-out, and flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 PLEASE read /usr/share/doc/nvidia-kernel-legacy-source/README.Debian for 
 building information.
 .

